{"page":98,"width":1880,"height":2861,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.7 IPC 시스템의 사례","words":[{"text":"3.7","x":1237,"y":180,"width":58,"height":25},{"text":"IPC","x":1313,"y":183,"width":45,"height":25},{"text":"시스템의","x":1368,"y":181,"width":99,"height":27},{"text":"사례","x":1476,"y":180,"width":49,"height":28}]},{"text":"151","words":[{"text":"151","x":1605,"y":176,"width":55,"height":30}]},{"text":"각 포트와 관련된 큐는 그기가 제한되어 있으며 처음에는 비어 있다. 메시지가 포트","words":[{"text":"각","x":379,"y":317,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"포트와","x":427,"y":318,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"관련된","x":541,"y":318,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"큐는","x":654,"y":320,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"그기가","x":736,"y":318,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"제한되어","x":851,"y":317,"width":130,"height":41},{"text":"있으며","x":1001,"y":317,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"처음에는","x":1118,"y":316,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"비어","x":1269,"y":317,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1352,"y":317,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"메시지가","x":1444,"y":316,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"포트","x":1597,"y":321,"width":70,"height":30}]},{"text":"로 전송되면 큐에 복사된다. 모든 메시지는 안정적으로 전달되며 동일한 우선순위를 가","words":[{"text":"로","x":316,"y":385,"width":33,"height":30},{"text":"전송되면","x":365,"y":381,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"큐에","x":513,"y":383,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"복사된다.","x":594,"y":384,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":753,"y":384,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"메시지는","x":836,"y":383,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"안정적으로","x":986,"y":382,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"전달되며","x":1173,"y":381,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"동일한","x":1322,"y":381,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"우선순위를","x":1441,"y":381,"width":177,"height":40},{"text":"가","x":1633,"y":382,"width":36,"height":38}]},{"text":"진다. Mach는 동일한 송신자의 여러 메시지가 선입선출대FO) 순서로 큐에 삽입하지","words":[{"text":"진다.","x":318,"y":446,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"Mach는","x":408,"y":449,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"동일한","x":554,"y":448,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"송신자의","x":669,"y":447,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":820,"y":448,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"메시지가","x":902,"y":447,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"선입선출대FO)","x":1054,"y":447,"width":249,"height":41},{"text":"순서로","x":1320,"y":447,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"큐에","x":1441,"y":447,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"삽입하지","x":1525,"y":446,"width":138,"height":39}]},{"text":"만 절대적 순서를 보장하지는 않는다. 예를 들어, 두 명의 송신자가 보낸 메시지는 임의","words":[{"text":"만","x":317,"y":512,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"절대적","x":366,"y":511,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"순서를","x":480,"y":512,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"보장하지는","x":595,"y":512,"width":168,"height":40},{"text":"않는다.","x":777,"y":512,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"예를","x":903,"y":512,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"들어,","x":982,"y":512,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":1075,"y":514,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"명의","x":1125,"y":512,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"송신자가","x":1205,"y":511,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"보낸","x":1357,"y":512,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"메시지는","x":1442,"y":511,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"임의","x":1599,"y":511,"width":65,"height":39}]},{"text":"의 순서로 큐에 저장된다.","words":[{"text":"의","x":317,"y":577,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"순서로","x":362,"y":577,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"큐에","x":476,"y":578,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"저장된다.","x":557,"y":577,"width":139,"height":40}]},{"text":"Mach 메시지에는 다음 두 필드를 포함한다.","words":[{"text":"Mach","x":379,"y":645,"width":96,"height":32},{"text":"메시지에는","x":489,"y":642,"width":169,"height":41},{"text":"다음","x":670,"y":643,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":748,"y":645,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"필드를","x":795,"y":643,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"포함한다.","x":907,"y":643,"width":143,"height":40}]},{"text":"• 고정 크기의 메시지 헤더. 헤더는 메시지 크기, 소스 및 대상 포트를 포함한 메시지","words":[{"text":"•","x":339,"y":752,"width":14,"height":16},{"text":"고정","x":379,"y":741,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"크기의","x":462,"y":742,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"메시지","x":579,"y":742,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"헤더.","x":694,"y":742,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"헤더는","x":786,"y":742,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"메시지","x":902,"y":742,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"크기,","x":1017,"y":743,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"소스","x":1109,"y":745,"width":68,"height":30},{"text":"및","x":1194,"y":742,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"대상","x":1241,"y":741,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"포트를","x":1323,"y":743,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"포함한","x":1441,"y":741,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"메시지","x":1561,"y":741,"width":100,"height":39}]},{"text":"에 관한 메타 데이터를 포함한다. 일반적으로 송신 스레드는 응답을 예상하므로 소","words":[{"text":"에","x":380,"y":807,"width":29,"height":40},{"text":"관한","x":427,"y":808,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"메타","x":511,"y":808,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":594,"y":808,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"포함한다.","x":744,"y":808,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"일반적으로","x":906,"y":808,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"송신","x":1088,"y":808,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"스레드는","x":1171,"y":807,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"응답을","x":1322,"y":807,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"예상하므로","x":1443,"y":807,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"소","x":1630,"y":809,"width":36,"height":29}]},{"text":"스의 포트 이름이 수신 태스크로 전달되어 응답을 보내는 데 “반환 주소”로 A卜\u0026할","words":[{"text":"스의","x":379,"y":873,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"포트","x":462,"y":878,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"이름이","x":546,"y":874,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"수신","x":660,"y":875,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"태스크로","x":745,"y":874,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"전달되어","x":897,"y":874,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"응답을","x":1047,"y":874,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"보내는","x":1165,"y":873,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"데","x":1282,"y":873,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"“반환","x":1331,"y":872,"width":84,"height":39},{"text":"주소”로","x":1429,"y":872,"width":118,"height":39},{"text":"A卜\u0026할","x":1562,"y":872,"width":105,"height":39}]},{"text":"수 있다.","words":[{"text":"수","x":379,"y":939,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":427,"y":940,"width":72,"height":40}]},{"text":"• 데이터를 포함하는 가변 크기 본체","words":[{"text":"•","x":340,"y":1029,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"데이터를","x":381,"y":1018,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"포함하는","x":527,"y":1018,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"가변","x":676,"y":1019,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"크기","x":755,"y":1019,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"본체","x":836,"y":1018,"width":66,"height":40}]},{"text":"메시지는 단순하거나 복잡할 수 있다. 간단한 메시지는 커널에 의해 해석되지 않는","words":[{"text":"메시지는","x":382,"y":1153,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"단순하거나","x":532,"y":1152,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"복잡할","x":714,"y":1153,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":833,"y":1153,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":886,"y":1153,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"간단한","x":978,"y":1153,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"메시지는","x":1098,"y":1152,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"커널에","x":1250,"y":1150,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"의해","x":1368,"y":1149,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"해석되지","x":1451,"y":1146,"width":133,"height":42},{"text":"않는","x":1605,"y":1145,"width":68,"height":40}]},{"text":"구조화되지 않은 보통의 사용자 데이터를 포함한다. 복잡한 메시지는 \"out-of-line” 데","words":[{"text":"구조화되지","x":320,"y":1219,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"않은","x":503,"y":1218,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"보통의","x":584,"y":1219,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"사용자","x":702,"y":1219,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":822,"y":1218,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"포함한다.","x":976,"y":1219,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"복잡한","x":1139,"y":1217,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"메시지는","x":1258,"y":1216,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"\"out-of-line”","x":1411,"y":1213,"width":212,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":1640,"y":1213,"width":30,"height":39}]},{"text":"이터를 포함하는 메모리 위치에 대한 포인터를 포함하거나 다른 태스크에 포트 권한을","words":[{"text":"이터를","x":322,"y":1286,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"포함하는","x":435,"y":1285,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"메모리","x":585,"y":1285,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"위치에","x":704,"y":1285,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"대한","x":822,"y":1285,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"포인터를","x":906,"y":1285,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"포함하거나","x":1063,"y":1284,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"다른","x":1250,"y":1284,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"태스크에","x":1335,"y":1282,"width":134,"height":41},{"text":"포트","x":1487,"y":1286,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"권한을","x":1571,"y":1280,"width":103,"height":40}]},{"text":"전송하는 데 사용될 수 있다. Out-of-hne 데이터 포인터는 메시지가 많은 양의 데이터","words":[{"text":"전송하는","x":323,"y":1352,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"데","x":469,"y":1352,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"사용될","x":515,"y":1351,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":630,"y":1352,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":681,"y":1352,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"Out-of-hne","x":771,"y":1353,"width":196,"height":33},{"text":"데이터","x":984,"y":1352,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"포인터는","x":1102,"y":1351,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"메시지가","x":1254,"y":1350,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"많은","x":1405,"y":1350,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"양의","x":1488,"y":1350,"width":64,"height":41},{"text":"데이터","x":1571,"y":1349,"width":98,"height":40}]},{"text":"를 전달해야 할 때 특히 유용하다. 간단한 메시지는 메시지의 데이터를 복사하고 패기징","words":[{"text":"를","x":321,"y":1420,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"전달해야","x":368,"y":1418,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":512,"y":1418,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":560,"y":1418,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"특히","x":605,"y":1418,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"유용하다.","x":686,"y":1417,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"간단한","x":849,"y":1417,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"메시지는","x":968,"y":1418,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"메시지의","x":1120,"y":1418,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":1270,"y":1417,"width":136,"height":42},{"text":"복사하고","x":1417,"y":1418,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"패기징","x":1569,"y":1417,"width":98,"height":41}]},{"text":"해야 한다. Out-of-line 데이터 전송에는 데이터가 저장된 메모리 위치를 가리기는 포인","words":[{"text":"해야","x":322,"y":1485,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":399,"y":1484,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"Out-of-line","x":486,"y":1486,"width":190,"height":33},{"text":"데이터","x":691,"y":1484,"width":98,"height":41},{"text":"전송에는","x":808,"y":1485,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"데이터가","x":960,"y":1485,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"저장된","x":1112,"y":1485,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"메모리","x":1225,"y":1486,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"위치를","x":1338,"y":1486,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"가리기는","x":1451,"y":1486,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"포인","x":1601,"y":1486,"width":68,"height":38}]},{"text":"터만 필요하다.","words":[{"text":"터만","x":323,"y":1551,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"필요하다.","x":400,"y":1550,"width":139,"height":40}]},{"text":"mach-msg() 함수는 메시지를 보내고 받는 표준 API이다. 함수의 매개변수 중 하","words":[{"text":"mach-msg()","x":381,"y":1621,"width":195,"height":39},{"text":"함수는","x":597,"y":1617,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"메시지를","x":715,"y":1618,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"보내고","x":869,"y":1618,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"받는","x":990,"y":1618,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"표준","x":1072,"y":1621,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"API이다.","x":1153,"y":1619,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"함수의","x":1314,"y":1620,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"매개변수","x":1432,"y":1619,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"중","x":1587,"y":1619,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"하","x":1638,"y":1618,"width":36,"height":38}]},{"text":"나가 MACH-SEND-MSG 또는 MACH-RCV-MSG 값을 가지며 송신 또는 수신 연산인지를","words":[{"text":"나가","x":323,"y":1684,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"MACH-SEND-MSG","x":403,"y":1690,"width":261,"height":31},{"text":"또는","x":683,"y":1686,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"MACH-RCV-MSG","x":768,"y":1690,"width":249,"height":31},{"text":"값을","x":1035,"y":1684,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"가지며","x":1120,"y":1685,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"송신","x":1237,"y":1685,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"또는","x":1323,"y":1688,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"수신","x":1409,"y":1685,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"연산인지를","x":1500,"y":1683,"width":174,"height":40}]},{"text":"나타낸다. 이제 클라이언트 태스크가 서버 태스크에 간단한 메시지를 보낼 때 사용되","words":[{"text":"나타낸다.","x":322,"y":1750,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"이제","x":483,"y":1750,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"클라이언트","x":565,"y":1751,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"태스크가","x":754,"y":1750,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"서버","x":910,"y":1750,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"태스크에","x":998,"y":1751,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"간단한","x":1150,"y":1752,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"메시지를","x":1270,"y":1752,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"보낼","x":1426,"y":1751,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1516,"y":1751,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"사용되","x":1568,"y":1750,"width":102,"height":40}]},{"text":"는 방법을 설명한다. 클라이언트 및 서버 태스크와 각각 연관된 두 개의 포트(client와","words":[{"text":"는","x":321,"y":1818,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"방법을","x":368,"y":1816,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"설명한다.","x":480,"y":1816,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"클라이언트","x":635,"y":1817,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"및","x":822,"y":1817,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"서버","x":868,"y":1816,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"태스크와","x":951,"y":1816,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"각각","x":1098,"y":1818,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"연관된","x":1182,"y":1817,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1294,"y":1819,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"개의","x":1344,"y":1817,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"포트(client와","x":1426,"y":1817,"width":249,"height":42}]},{"text":"server)가 있다고 가정하자. 그림 3.18의 코드는 클라이언트 태스크가 헤더를 구성하","words":[{"text":"server)가","x":324,"y":1882,"width":164,"height":41},{"text":"있다고","x":506,"y":1882,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"가정하자.","x":620,"y":1882,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"그림","x":780,"y":1883,"width":65,"height":38},{"text